_639_1":"en","iso_3166_1":"US","name":"English","english_name":"English","title":"","overview":"The life story of ‘Zen Anarchist’ filmmaker John Milius, one of the most influential storytellers of his generation.","tagline":"Man. Myth. Legend."},{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"ES","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","title":"","overview":"La historia de uno de los directores más controvertidos de la historia de Hollywood, John Milius. Desde sus aspiraciones infantiles por unirse al ejército hasta su abandono de la industria por sus creencias radicales y comportamiento volátil, Milius ha dejado un trabajo legendario en películas como Apocalypse Now, Tiburón, Conan el Bárbaro o Harry el Sucio.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ru","iso_3166_1":"RU","name":"Pусский","english_name":"Russian","title":"Милиус","overview":"Взгляните на жизнь режиссера Джона Милиуса.","tagline":"«Подлинная история величайшего режиссера, которую вы никогда не знали»"},{"iso_639_1":"nl","iso_3166_1":"NL","name":"Nederlands","english_name":"Dutch","title":"","overview":"'Milius' belicht het levensverhaal van een van de meest invloedrijke en controversiële filmmakers in de geschiedenis van Hollywood, John Milius. Vanaf zijn jeugdaspiraties om in het leger te gaan tot aan de jaren op de USC Film School. Aan bod komen zijn medewerking aan legendarische werken als \"Apocalypse Now\", \"Jaws\", \"Conan The Barbarian\", \"Dirty Harry\" en \"Red Dawn\". Uiteindelijk neemt hij afscheid van Hollywood vanwege zijn radicale opvattingen en controversiële gedrag. De film bevat diepte-interviews met Milius zelf en anderen als Steven Spielberg, George Lucas, Arnold Schwarzenegger en Francis Ford Coppola.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"fr","iso_3166_1":"FR","name":"Français","english_name":"French","title":"Milius","overview":"Focus sur la vie de John Milius.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"CN","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"米利厄斯","overview":"说到二十世纪后期最具影响力和标志性的电影人，一定不会漏掉集编剧、导演、制片人于一身的约翰·米利厄斯，随手翻翻他的履历也足以让影迷们吓尿了。《现代启示录》、《大白鲨》等经典名作的剧本皆出自他手，合作过的大导演更不计其数。Joey Figueroa和Zak Knutson执导的这部纪录片《神一样的电影人约翰》就请来了史蒂文·斯皮尔伯格、乔治·卢卡斯、阿诺·施瓦辛格、弗朗西斯·福特·科波拉、哈里森·福特、迈克尔·曼、罗伯特·泽米吉斯、奥利佛·斯通、布莱恩·辛格、查理·辛、马修·维纳等电影圈的大腕们一起来聊聊这位神一样的电影人约翰·米利厄斯。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ko","iso_3166_1":"KR","name":"한국어/조선말","english_name":"Korean","title":"밀리어스","overview":"","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"DE","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"","overview":"Milius ist eine Dokumentation und Verbeugung gleichermaßen vor einem wegen seiner Überzeugung umstrittenen, aber nichtsdestotrotz ikonischen Filmemacher Hollywoods: John Milius.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"HK","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"米利厄斯","overview":"説到二十世紀後期最具影響力和標志性的電影人，一定不會漏掉集編劇、導演、制片人於一身的約翰·米利厄斯，隨手翻翻他的履歷也足以讓影迷們嚇尿了。《現代啟示錄》、《大白鯊》等經典名作的劇本皆出自他手，合作過的大導演更不計其數。Joey Figueroa 和 Zak Knutson 執導的這部紀錄片《神一樣的電影人約翰》就請來了史蒂文·斯皮爾伯格、喬治·盧卡斯、阿諾·施瓦辛格、弗朗西斯·福特·科波拉、哈里森·福特、邁克爾·曼、羅伯特·澤米吉斯、奧利佛·斯通、布萊恩·辛格、查理·辛、馬修·維納等電影圈的大人物們一起來聊聊這位神一樣的電影人約翰·米利厄斯。","tagline":""}],"videos":[{"key":"oLuPXfsCkWg","site":"YouTube","type":"Trailer","name":"Milius TRAILER 1 (2013) - Screenwriter/Director John Milius Documentary HD","iso_639_1":"en","official":false,"published_at":"2013-03-08T21:09:12.000Z","size":720}],"images":{"posters":[{"file_path":"/iCf2e0HvH2T42M4qxL25zu4dvU8.jpg","width":960,"height":1440,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":3.334,"vote_count":2},{"file_path":"/dpiIm2rpTNi6XpWnZPFU37D0eWm.jpg","width":800,"height":1200,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":2.066,"vote_count":5},{"file_path":"/mcpVIsd90P9Z2YysvmPYeeH6NLh.jpg","width":530,"height":755,"iso_639_1":"en","vote_average":0,"vote_count":0}],"backdrops":[{"file_path":"/eB1hcjLMkQgv3xSmeGpk7XwdNTc.jpg","width":1314,"height":739,"iso_639_1":null,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0}],"logos":[]},"recommendations":[{"id":565276,"title":"Love, Antosha","original_title":"Love, Antosha","release_date":"2019-08-02","poster_path":"/AntNP1sX7qKBT7hSYM4248